  "statement": "DS I/O for both CPUs: IME/IE/IF, IPCSYNC and the IPC FIFOs, timers (prescaler, count-up), DMA (immediate, V-blank, H-blank, start of display, cartridge per ready word, geometry FIFO), the ARM9 divider and square root, the cartridge bus (B7 block reads served from the ROM image, B8 chip ID), DISPSTAT/VCOUNT with the H-blank flag, KEYINPUT/EXTKEYIN, HALTCNT, POSTFLG, and the dispatch to the video, SPI, save chip, clock, sound and geometry cards. Every other register is latched (reads return the last write) and every register touched is recorded for the coverage report; an entry of modelled_registers marked (ARM7) or (ARM9) counts for that CPU only.",
